to_Justificado_Recuo_Primeira_Linha {font-size:12pt; font-family:Calibri; text-indent: 12.303059895833334%; text-align:justify; word-wrap:normal; margin:6pt; } p.Texto_Justificado_Recuo_Primeira_Linha_Esp_Simples {font-size:12pt; font-family:Calibri; text-indent: 12.303059895833334%; text-align:justify; word-wrap:normal; margin:0 0 0 6pt; } p.Texto_Justificado_Recuo_Primeira_Linha_Margem {font-size:12pt; font-family:Calibri; text-indent: 12.303059895833334%; text-align:justify; word-wrap:normal; margin-left: 4.921223958333334%; } p.Titulo_centralizado_maiusculas {font-size:12pt; font-family:Calibri; text-align:center; text-transform:uppercase; word-wrap:normal; margin:0 0 0 6pt; }; background-color: transparent !important</style></head>\n<body style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">\n\r\n\r\n<p class=\"\" style=\";\">Formaliza as altera&ccedil;&otilde;es na classifica&ccedil;&atilde;o dos CCESP e FCESP no Quadro Demonstrativo dos Cargos em Comiss&atilde;o e das Fun&ccedil;&otilde;es de Confian&ccedil;a da Secretaria da Justi&ccedil;a e Cidadania, constante do Anexo II, do Decreto n&ordm; 69.449/2025, nos termos do artigo 20, &sect;2&ordm;, do Decreto n&ordm; 68.742/2024.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">O SECRET&Aacute;RIO DA JUSTI&Ccedil;A E CIDADANIA</strong>, no uso da compet&ecirc;ncia estabelecida pelo artigo 20, &sect;2&ordm;, do Decreto n&ordm; 68.742, de 05 de agosto de 2.025,&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">RESOLVE</strong>:&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Artigo 1&ordm; - Ficam formalizadas as altera&ccedil;&otilde;es na classifica&ccedil;&atilde;o dos CCESP e FCESP no Quadro Demonstrativo dos Cargos em Comiss&atilde;o e das Fun&ccedil;&otilde;es de Confian&ccedil;a da Secretaria da Justi&ccedil;a e Cidadania, constante do Anexo II, do Decreto n&ordm; 69.449, de 27 de mar&ccedil;o de 2.025, que aprova a nova estrutura organizacional, nos termos da planilha anexa &agrave; presente resolu&ccedil;&atilde;o.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Artigo 2&ordm; - Esta resolu&ccedil;&atilde;o entra em vigor 10 (dez) dias &uacute;teis ap&oacute;s a data de sua publica&ccedil;&atilde;o.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center; margin-top:0; margin-right: 0.5208333333333333%; margin-bottom:0; margin-left: 0.5208333333333333%; background-color: transparent !important; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt; background-color: transparent !important; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri; background-color: transparent !important; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open San